        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "That Ayodhya is an impassable one for trespassers, or for others invaders, owing to her impassable and profound moats, and she is abounding with horses, camels, likewise with cows and donkeys. [1-5-13]"
      }
    ],
